('COM999999', 'MK DEMO', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 14, 'Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. It was popularised in the 1960s with the release of Letraset sheets containing Lorem Ipsum passages, and more recently with desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker including versions of Lorem Ipsum.', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 0, 1, 'Bahasa', 11, '2026-02-17 03:24:57', '2026-02-17 03:24:57'),
('LIRA15062026', 'lilstrore', 'lilstore', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 19, 'mempelajari bisnis', 50.00, 75.00, 2, 1, 1, 'Bahasa', 17, '2026-06-15 09:59:49', '2026-06-15 10:01:22'),
('MIP620101', 'BASIC SCIENCE', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, 'Basic science is a broad field of study that encompasses many different subjects, including biology, chemistry, and physics. At its core, basic science is focused on understanding the fundamental principles and concepts that govern our natural world.', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 0, 1, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 05:03:02', '2023-01-20 05:03:02'),
('MIP625101', 'Sains Dasar', 'Basic Science', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 14, 'Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. It was popularised in the 1960s with the release of Letraset sheets containing Lorem Ipsum passages, and more recently with desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker including versions of Lorem Ipsum.', 50.00, 75.00, 2, 0, 1, 'Bahasa', 11, '2026-01-27 14:01:57', '2026-02-21 03:22:33'),
('MIP625102', 'Penggunaan  Generative Artificial Intelligence', 'Applications of Generative Artificial Intelligence', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 14, 'Mata kuliah ini membahas konsep, prinsip, dan penerapan Generative Artificial Intelligence (GenAI) dalam konteks komputasi modern. Materi mencakup perbedaan AI, machine learning, dan deep learning, evaluasi kecerdasan mesin, mode kegagalan model generatif, serta isu etika dan dampak sosial penggunaan GenAI. Mahasiswa dilatih menganalisis, mengevaluasi, dan mengontekstualisasikan penggunaan GenAI secara kritis dan bertanggung jawab dalam berbagai skenario dunia nyata.', 50.00, 75.00, 2, 0, 1, 'Bahasa', 11, '2026-01-27 14:02:25', '2026-02-21 03:23:51'),
('UNI620101', 'ISLAMIC EDUCATION', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, 'Islamic education is the process of acquiring knowledge and skills in the Islamic faith and its teachings. This can include instruction in areas such as Quranic studies, Hadith, Fiqh (Islamic jurisprudence), Seerah (biography of the Prophet Muhammad), Aqeedah (Islamic theology), and Tafsir (exegesis of the Quran). The goal of Islamic education is to help individuals gain a deeper understanding of their religion, to develop a personal relationship with God and to become better Muslims.', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 1, 1, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 05:04:30', '2023-01-20 05:04:30'),
('UNI620102', 'CATHOLIC EDUCATION', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, '\"Catholic education refers to the study and understanding of the teachings and principles of the Catholic Church, which is one of the main Christian denominations. It encompasses a wide range of subjects, including the Bible, the history of the Catholic Church, and the beliefs, practices, and values of the Catholic faith.\r\nThis education aims to help students understand the basic concepts and principles of Catholicism and how it has shaped the culture and society. It also provides an understanding of the Catholic way of life, its spiritual beliefs, practices, and sacraments. This education usually includes the study of the Bible and the teachings of Jesus, as well as the study of the history, theology and liturgical practices of the Catholic Church. It may also include the study of the social teachings of the Catholic Church, such as the role of the Church in society and the importance of social justice.\"', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 1, 1, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 05:05:15', '2023-01-20 05:05:15'),
('UNI620103', 'CHRISTIAN EDUCATION', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, '\"Christian education refers to the study and understanding of the teachings and principles of Christianity. It encompasses a wide range of subjects, including the Bible, the history of Christianity, and the beliefs, practices, and values of the Christian faith.\r\nThis education aims to help students understand the basic concepts and principles of Christianity and how it has shaped the culture and society. It also provides an understanding of the Christian way of life and its spiritual beliefs and practices. This education usually includes the study of the New Testament and the teachings of Jesus, as well as the Old Testament and the history of Christianity. It may also include the study of Christian theology, ethics and the different denominational perspectives.\"', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 1, 1, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 05:07:43', '2023-01-20 05:07:43'),
('UNI620104', 'HINDU EDUCATION', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, 'Hindu education generally refers to the study and understanding of the teachings and principles of Hinduism. It encompasses a wide range of subjects, including the major texts and sacred scripture, the gods and goddesses of the Hindu pantheon, the history and development of Hinduism, and the philosophical and spiritual principles that underlie the tradition.', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 1, 1, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 05:12:11', '2023-01-20 05:12:11'),
('UNI620105', 'BUDDHA EDUCATION', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, 'Buddhist education generally refers to the study and understanding of the teachings and principles of Buddhism. It encompasses a wide range of subjects such as the Four Noble Truths, the Eightfold Path, mindfulness, and the role of meditation in spiritual development. It also includes the study of the life and teachings of the historical Buddha, Siddhartha Gautama, as well as the history and development of Buddhism as a religion and philosophy.', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 1, 1, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 05:15:43', '2023-01-20 05:15:43'),
('UNI620109', 'LOCAL ETHICS AND WISDOM EDUCATION', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, 'Local ethics and wisdom education is a type of curriculum that focuses on teaching the ethical principles and traditional wisdom of a specific culture or community. This can include studying the customs, beliefs, and values that shape the way people live, as well as the moral codes that guide their behavior.', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 0, 1, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 05:19:01', '2023-01-20 05:19:01'),
('UNI620306', 'INDONESIAN LANGUAGE EDUCATION', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, 'Indonesian Language Education is a course designed to teach students the basics of the Indonesian language, culture, and customs. The course is aimed at students who have no previous knowledge of the language and is designed to be interactive, engaging and fun. Students will learn to speak, read, and write in Indonesian, as well as develop a deeper understanding of the culture and customs of Indonesia. The course covers topics such as basic grammar, vocabulary, sentence structure, and conversational phrases. Throughout the course, students will have the opportunity to practice their language skills through interactive activities, group discussions, and role-playing exercises. By the end of the course, students will have developed a solid foundation in the Indonesian language and will be able to communicate effectively with native speakers.', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 0, 2, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 05:28:55', '2023-01-20 05:28:55'),
('UNI620307', 'CIVIC EDUCATION', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, 'Civic Education is a course that teaches students about their rights and responsibilities as citizens of a country. It covers a wide range of topics, including the history and structure of government, political systems, and the role of citizens in civic engagement. Students learn about the foundations of democracy and the importance of active participation in the democratic process. They explore the branches of government and the role of the judiciary, the legislative, and the executive branches in shaping public policy. Students also learn about political parties, elections, and the role of the media in shaping public opinion.', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 0, 2, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 05:29:48', '2023-01-20 05:29:48'),
('UNI620401', 'COMMUNITY SERVICE PROGRAM', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 1, '\"Community service programs provide computer science students with an opportunity to use their skills and knowledge to make a positive impact on their local community. \r\nBy participating in community service programs, computer science students can apply their skills and knowledge to make a difference in their communities and gain valuable experience that can help them to grow professionally\"', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 1, 7, 'Bahasa', 4, '2023-01-20 07:28:43', '2023-01-20 07:28:43'),
('UNI625107', 'Pancasila', 'Pancasila', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 14, 'Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. It was popularised in the 1960s with the release of Letraset sheets containing Lorem Ipsum passages, and more recently with desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker including versions of Lorem Ipsum.', 50.00, 75.00, 2, 0, 1, 'Bahasa', 11, '2026-01-27 14:00:29', '2026-02-21 03:26:35'),
('UNI625109', 'Bahasa Indonesia', 'Indonesian Language Course', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 14, 'Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book. It has survived not only five centuries, but also the leap into electronic typesetting, remaining essentially unchanged. It was popularised in the 1960s with the release of Letraset sheets containing Lorem Ipsum passages, and more recently with desktop publishing software like Aldus PageMaker including versions of Lorem Ipsum.', 0.00, 0.00, 2, 0, 2, 'Bahasa', 11, '2026-01-27 14:06:17', '2026-03-06 04:27:48'),
('UNI625201', 'Kewirausahaan', 'Entrepreneurship', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 14, 'Mata kuliah ini membahas konsep dasar kewirausahaan serta proses pengembangan dan pengelolaan usaha. Materi meliputi identifikasi peluang bisnis, pengembangan ide usaha, penyusunan model bisnis, perencanaan usaha, strategi pemasaran, serta pengelolaan keuangan dasar dalam bisnis. Selain itu, mahasiswa juga diperkenalkan pada pengembangan sikap kreatif, inovatif, dan kemampuan mengambil keputusan dalam kegiatan wirausaha. Setelah mengikuti mata kuliah ini, mahasiswa diharapkan mampu memahami prinsip-prinsip kewirausahaan dan memiliki kemampuan dasar dalam merancang serta mengembangkan usaha secara mandiri.', 70.00, 76.00, 2, 1, 4, 'Bahasa', 11, '2026-01-27 14:23:35', '2026-03-06 04:33:32'),
('UNI825101', 'Filsafat Ilmu', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 13, '-', 0.00, 0.00, 3, 0, 1, 'Bahasa', 12, '2025-07-15 07:51:39', '2025-07-15 07:51:39'),
('UNI825102', 'Metodologi Penelitian', '', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 13, '-', 0.00, 0.00, 3, 0, 2, 'Bahasa', 12, '2025-07-15 08:05:35', '2025-07-15 08:05:35'),
('UNL625108', 'Kewarganegaraan', 'Civic Education', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 14, 'Mata kuliah ini membahas konsep dasar kewarganegaraan dalam kehidupan berbangsa dan bernegara. Materi meliputi nilai-nilai Pancasila, Undang-Undang Dasar Negara Republik Indonesia Tahun 1945, hak dan kewajiban warga negara, sistem pemerintahan, demokrasi, serta peran warga negara dalam menjaga persatuan dan keutuhan bangsa. Melalui mata kuliah ini, mahasiswa diharapkan memiliki pemahaman mengenai prinsip-prinsip kehidupan bernegara serta mampu menunjukkan sikap tanggung jawab sebagai warga negara yang baik dalam kehidupan bermasyarakat, berbangsa, dan bernegara.', 70.00, 76.00, 2, 0, 4, 'Bahasa', 11, '2026-01-27 14:23:07', '2026-03-06 04:33:59'),
('UNL62510X', 'Pendidikan  Agama', 'Religious Education', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 14, 'Deskripsi Mata Kuliah PAI Masih Dummy', 50.00, 75.00, 3, 0, 1, 'Bahasa', 11, '2026-01-27 13:58:36', '2026-02-21 03:26:53'),
('UNL625301', 'Kuliah Kerja Nyata', 'Kuliah Kerja Nyata', 'Wajib', 'Tidak ada', 14, 'Kuliah Kerja Nyata (KKN) merupakan kegiatan pengabdian kepada masyarakat yang memberikan kesempatan kepada mahasiswa untuk menerapkan pengetahuan dan keterampilan yang telah diperoleh selama perkuliahan dalam kehidupan nyata di masyarakat. Kegiatan ini dilaksanakan melalui berbagai program pemberdayaan masyarakat yang bersifat multidisiplin, seperti pendidikan, teknologi, ekonomi, dan sosial. Melalui kegiatan ini, mahasiswa diharapkan mampu mengembangkan sikap kepemimpinan, kerja sama, serta kepedulian terhadap permasalahan yang ada di masyarakat.', 76.00, 76.00, 2, 1, 6, 'Bahasa', 11, '2026-01-27 14:31:09', '2026-03-06 04:45:52');
